$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 2-(2-Bromophenoxy)-6-(2-fluorophenyl)benzonitrile (4a). 2-Bromophenol
(0.16 mL, 1.5 mmol), 2-fluoro-6-(2-fluorophenyl)benzonitrile (7) (217 mg,
1.01 mmol) and freshly ground K2CO3 (276 mg, 2.0 mmol) were stirred in
DMF (1 mL) at 100°C under N2 for 24 hours. At rt sat. NH4Cl (20 mL) was
added. Extraction with Et2O (5×20 mL) and the combined organic phases
were washed once with brine (20 mL). Drying (Na2SO4) and evaporation of
the solvent gave the crude product which was purified by FC
(heptane/EtOAc) yielding 343 mg (92%) of 4a as colorless crystals. mp
94-96 °C (heptane/EtOAc), Rf (heptane/EtOAc 4:1) 0.37. 1H-NMR (300 MHz,
CDCl3): 6.68 (dd, 1H, J=8.5, 0.9 Hz), 7.14-7.32 (m, 5H), 7.35-7.53 (m,
4H), 7.69 (dd, 1H, J=7.8,1.5 Hz). 13C-NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3): 103.7 (s),
114.6 (d), 114.7 (s), 115.99 (s), 116.02 (d), 116.3 (d), 122.5 (d), 124.3
(d(d), JC-F=4.0 Hz), 124.8 (d(d), JC-F=1.9 Hz), 125.4 (s(d), JC-F=14.6
Hz), 127.0 (d), 129.0 (d), 131.0 (d(d), JC-F=8.0 Hz), 131.2 (d(d),
JC-F=2.3 Hz), 133.4 (d), 134.2 (d), 141.5 (s), 151.5 (s), 159.4 (s(d),
JC-F=249 Hz), 159.8 (s). Anal Calcd. for C19H11BrFNO: C, 61.98; H, 3.01;
N, 3.80. Found: C, 61.87; H, 2.78, N, 3.77.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis of Pentacyclic 13-Azadibenzo[a,de]anthracenes via Anionic
Cascade Ring Closure
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Kristensen, Jesper L.; Vedso, Per; Begtrup, Mikael
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2003), 68(10), 4091-4092

